        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          At Riverside Cottages, we believe a successful resort should benefit more than just its guests. We aim to create a welcoming environment for visitors while supporting local communities and helping protect the rainforest landscapes that make Khao Sok such a special place to experience.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Sustainability & Conservation</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Many aspects of Riverside Cottages have been designed to work with the surrounding environment rather than against it. Raised walkways, natural ventilation, locally sourced materials, refill water stations, and other low-impact practices help reduce our environmental footprint while allowing guests to remain closely connected to nature.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We also support conservation initiatives, environmental education programmes, and local partnerships that help protect the natural and cultural heritage of the Khao Sok region.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Learn more about our <a href="/sustainability/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">sustainability practices and conservation efforts</a>.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Community Partnerships</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Riverside Cottages is proud to work alongside local guides, small businesses, educators, and community organisations throughout Southern Thailand. We believe tourism creates the greatest long-term benefit when local people are empowered to share their knowledge, culture, and livelihoods with visitors.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Through partnerships with organisations supporting education, conservation, and community development, we aim to contribute positively to the communities connected to Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Discover the story behind our <a href="/sustainable-community-led-tourism/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">community-led tourism philosophy</a>.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Why Guests Choose Riverside Cottages</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Every visitor experiences Khao Sok differently, but many tell us the same thing after they arrive: Riverside Cottages feels connected to the rainforest in a way that is increasingly difficult to find.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Set beside the Sok River and surrounded by tropical forest, the resort offers a peaceful setting where guests can slow down, relax, and experience nature at their own pace. Monkeys are often seen across the river, birds call from the forest canopy, and the sounds of flowing water and wildlife form the backdrop to everyday life.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Guests choose Riverside Cottages for many reasons:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>A quiet riverside location surrounded by nature</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Easy access to<a href="/khao-sok-national-park/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors"> Khao Sok National Park</a> and <a href="/khao-sok-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">local activities</a></span>
          </li>
