          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>A relaxed atmosphere that encourages guests to disconnect and unwind</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Whether you are visiting Khao Sok for hiking, <a href="/khao-sok-jungle-thailand-rainforest/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">wildlife</a>, lake tours, family adventures, or simply to spend time in nature, our goal is to help you experience the region in a way that feels personal, memorable, and authentic.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Sharing the River with Wildlife</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          One of the most rewarding aspects of staying at Riverside Cottages is the opportunity to observe wildlife without leaving the resort grounds.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Guests regularly spot monkeys moving through the trees across the river, monitor lizards along the banks, colourful kingfishers, butterflies, and a wide variety of rainforest birds. During quieter moments, simply sitting beside the river with a coffee can become a memorable wildlife experience in itself.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The surrounding rainforest is home to an extraordinary diversity of plants and animals, and many guests discover that some of their favourite wildlife encounters happen not on a tour, but from the comfort of the resort itself.
        </p>
